  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "xby-french-tax",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 的插件：法国个人所得税计算服务\n\n一个提供法国个人所得税计算的MCP服务器，支持基于净应税收入和家庭构成的计算，并动态获取最新税档信息。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- **set_xby_apikey** — 在聊天中设置 API 密钥（自动持久化，重启有效）\n- **get_tax_info_from_web** — Get tax information from official French government websites like impots.gouv.fr, service-public.fr, or legifrance.gouv.fr\n- **get_tax_brackets** — Get income tax brackets (tranches d'imposition) for a specific year\n- **get_form_details** — Get detailed information about a specific tax form including fields and instructions\n- **get_cached_tax_info** — Get cached tax information when web scraping fails\n- **calculate_income_tax** — Calculate French income tax based on net taxable income and household composition\n- **get_tax_procedure** — Get information about a tax procedure from service-public.fr\n- **get_tax_deadlines** — Get tax deadlines from service-public.fr\n- **health_check** — Simple health check to verify the server is responsive\n- **get_tax_article** — Get information about a tax law article from legifrance.gouv.fr\n- **search_tax_law** — Search for tax law articles on legifrance.gouv.fr\n- **generate_tax_report** — Generate a detailed report about a specific tax topic"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：从 GitHub 直接安装（推荐）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "格式: dsh plugin --profile <profile> add github:<owner>/<repo>",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:xby_skill/xby-french-tax\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：从本地目录安装（开发模式）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "仅用于本地开发调试",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add /absolute/path/to/xby-french-tax\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式三：通过 cordis.patch.yml 开发调试",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh web --profile web --patch /absolute/path/to/dsh-ocr-plugin/cordis.patch.yml\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取 API 密钥",
      "text": "前往 [小笨羊官网](https://xiaobenyang.com) 注册并获取 API 密钥。"
    }
  ],
